<div id="forSellers">
    <h3>For Sellers</h3>
    <p class="fs-5">At our website, we provide a simplistic and user-friendly platform for listing your books. We
        understand the
        importance of an easy and hassle-free process, so we've designed our book listing feature to be intuitive and
        straightforward. With just a few simple steps, you can easily add your books to our platform and make them
        available for sale. Our goal is to simplify the book listing process, allowing you to quickly and efficiently
        showcase your books to potential buyers. Experience the convenience of listing your books with us and reach a
        wider audience of interested buyers.
    </p>
</div>

<div id="listBooks">
    <h4>How To List Your Books?</h4>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Once you have joined as a seller through our <a href="/join_us">Join Us</a> page, you will be redirected to your
        personalized dashboard. From there, you can easily navigate to the "Your Books" tab and click on "Add New Book"
        to
        start listing your books.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        As a seller, it's important to have a pickup address where our Book Heroes can collect the books from
        you and deliver them to the buyers. To ensure a seamless process, we kindly request you to add your pickup
        address first.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        To facilitate the payment process, we kindly ask sellers to provide their bank account details or UPI ID. This
        information allows us to transfer your earnings securely and efficiently.
    </p>
    <p class="fw-bold fs-5">Please note that a service fee of 10% will be deducted from the total earnings of every
        successful order. This
        fee helps cover the costs associated with maintaining and operating our platform, ensuring continued service and
        support for sellers like you.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        By providing your preferred payment details and understanding the applicable service fee, you can receive your
        earnings promptly and conveniently. We prioritize the security and confidentiality of your financial information
        throughout the payment process.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Once you have added your pickup address, you can proceed to add your books, providing all the necessary details.
        These books will then be listed on our dedicated <a href="/books">Books</a> page, where potential buyers can
        browse and discover them.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        By following these simple steps, you can efficiently manage your book listings and connect with interested
        buyers. Your personalized dashboard serves as a central hub to keep track of your listings, orders, and other
        important information.
    </p>
    <h5>What are the guidelines for book images on our platform?</h5>
    <p class="fs-5">
        To ensure a consistent and appealing display of books on our platform, we have specific guidelines for book
        images. When uploading an image of the book, please make sure it meets the following requirements:
    </p>
    <ol class="list-group list-group-numbered mt-2 mb-3">
        <li class="list-group-item fs-5">
            Image Content: The image should prominently feature the front cover of the book. It should be the main focus
            and showcase the book attractively.
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item fs-5">
            White Padding: The book image should be padded with a white background color. This adds a clean and
            professional look to the image and enhances its visual presentation.
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item fs-5">
            File Size: The image file size should be kept below 2MB. This ensures faster loading times and optimal
            website performance.
        </li>
        <li class="list-group-item fs-5">
            Dimensions: Both width and height should be 500 pixels. Maintaining these
            dimensions allows for consistent and visually pleasing book display across our platform.
        </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="fs-5">
        By adhering to these guidelines, you can present your book in the best possible way, attracting potential buyers
        with a clear and visually appealing image.
    </p>
</div>

<div id="receiveBookOrders">
    <h4>How would you know if someone wants to buy your books?</h4>
    <p class="fs-5">
        When a buyer places an order for your listed books and their payment is successfully verified, you will receive
        an order in your dashboard in "Received Orders" tab. There you can see the order ID and details of the books
        that have been
        ordered, including their quantities.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Once you receive the order, we kindly request you to keep the books handy, along with their
        respective order IDs. Our dedicated Book Heroes will promptly swing by to pick up the books from your designated
        location.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        By following this process, you can ensure a smooth and efficient handover of the books to our delivery team,
        ensuring a seamless experience for both you as a seller and the buyer.
    </p>
</div>
<div id="payYou">
    <h4>How will you receive your earnings?</h4>
    <p class="fw-bold fs-5">Please note that a service fee of 10% will be deducted from the total earnings of every
        successful order. This
        fee helps cover the costs associated with maintaining and operating our platform, ensuring continued service and
        support for sellers like you.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Upon the successful completion of each order, which indicates that the buyer has not returned the order within 5
        days, we will initiate the transfer of your earnings. These earnings will be sent to the UPI ID that you have saved in your account.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Ensuring a seamless and hassle-free payment process, we prioritize the timely transfer of your earnings. By
        providing and maintaining your accurate payment information, you can receive your earnings securely and
        conveniently.
    </p>
    <p class="fs-5">
        Our commitment is to facilitate a transparent and efficient payment system that rewards your efforts as a
        seller. Rest assured that your earnings will be transferred to your designated payment method after the
        successful completion of each order.
    </p>
</div>